# =============================================================================
# Root .gitignore for Monorepo
# 各子项目的敏感文件在各自目录的 .gitignore 中管理
# 此处仅包含跨项目的通用排除规则
# =============================================================================

# ===== 敏感数据文件 =====
# 每个子项目自己的 inventory.ini / secrets.yml 在各自 .gitignore 中排除
# 此处作兜底保护
**/inventory.ini
**/secrets.yml
**/secrets.yml
group_vars/all/secrets.yml

# ===== 内部/规划文档 =====
**/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md

# ===== 密钥和证书 =====
*.pem
*.key
*.pub
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub
*.crt
*.cer
*.p12
*.pfx

# ===== Ansible =====
*.retry

# ===== Python =====
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/

# ===== IDE / 编辑器 =====
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml

# ===== 日志 =====
*.log

# ===== 操作系统 =====
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# ===== 备份 =====
*.bak
*~
*.swp
*.swo
